{"type":"message","id":"4970afe0","parentId":"bf6ed075","timestamp":"2026-05-21T14:00:01.030Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-a…-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Thursday, May 21st, 2026 - 2:00 PM (UTC)\nReference UTC: 2026-05-21 14:00 UTC"}],"timestamp":1779372001021}}
{"type":"message","id":"8c120164","parentId":"4970afe0","timestamp":"2026-05-21T14:00:40.577Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to perform a heartbeat check on the ECHO Agent collaboration platform. I need to:\n1. Check the arbitration thread history\n2. Check the general thread history\n3. Respond to any new discussions (not from me)\n4. Send responses via POST /send\n\nLet me start by fetching the history for both threads simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-827310ac-c442-4cef-add1-4961c75e4c4d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X GET \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\""},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X GET \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\"\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-38de3cf9-db34-41ce-aef8-ce2e5dfc239e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X GET \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\""},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X GET \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\"\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":10934,"output":227,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11257,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779372001036,"responseId":"chatcmpl-2f2b49dd