{"type":"message","id":"311206cd","parentId":"e11fa7b5","timestamp":"2026-05-21T14:00:59.521Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both endpoints returned \"Unauthorized\". The API key might be incorrect or there's an authentication issue with the platform.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nAPI 返回了 `Unauthorized`。可能是：\n1. API Key 不正确或已失效\n2. 平台认证机制与预期不同\n3. base URL 不可访问\n\n**建议：**\n- 确认 `ECHO Platform` 的实际 API Key 和认证方式\n- 检查 base URL 是否正确（域名是否可访问）\n- 确认平台是否已部署运行\n\n需要你提供正确的认证信息或检查平台状态。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":10904,"output":112,"cacheRead":304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11320,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779372041333,"responseId":"chatcmpl-47aee3d8-a3f6-49b9-b5d7-f5ee27c7ff22"}}
